---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const guides = (await getCollection("blog"))
  .filter((post) => !post.data.draft && post.data.category === "Buy & Sell")
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.getTime() - a.data.pubDate.getTime())
  .slice(0, 4);

const formatDate = (date) => date.toLocaleDateString("en-CA", {
  timeZone: "UTC", month: "long", day: "numeric", year: "numeric"
});
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Buy a Home in Ontario | Dongho Lee Real Estate"
  description="Clear, practical guidance for buying a home in Ontario - from planning and mortgage preparation to offers and closing."
>
  <section class="services-hero">
    <p class="page-kicker">Buy a Home</p>
    <h1>Buy with a Clear Plan</h1>
    <p class="lead">Whether this is your first home, your next move, or a new start in Canada, we turn the buying process into practical next steps. From financing and neighbourhood choices to offers and closing, each decision stays connected to your timeline and priorities.</p>
    <p class="lead ko">첫 주택 구매, 이사, 신규 이민 후 정착까지 - 예산과 지역, 오퍼와 클로징 과정을 이해하기 쉽게 함께 정리합니다. 현재 상황과 일정에 맞춰 무엇부터 결정할지 분명하게 안내합니다.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions journey-hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=buy_consultation">무료 구매 상담 신청하기</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="tel:14166258241">Call · 전화 416-625-8241</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="conversion-panel" aria-label="How Dongho helps home buyers">
    <div class="conversion-copy">
      <p class="page-kicker">Start Here</p>
      <h2>Buying a home is more than finding a listing.</h2>
      <p>We begin with your timeline, budget, financing and preferred areas. From there, you get a clear search strategy, current market context and support through offer, conditions and closing.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="conversion-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=buy_consultation">무료 구매 상담 신청하기</a>
      <span>한국어 · English 상담 가능</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-grid journey-steps" aria-label="Home buying support">
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">01</div>
      <h2>Plan <span>구매 준비</span></h2>
      <h3>Budget, financing and priorities</h3>
      <p>예산, 모기지 준비, 원하는 지역과 생활 조건을 함께 정리합니다.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">02</div>
      <h2>Search <span>매물 탐색</span></h2>
      <h3>A focused home search</h3>
      <p>지역·학군·시세를 바탕으로 실제 선택 가능한 매물을 비교합니다.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">03</div>
      <h2>Offer <span>오퍼 전략</span></h2>
      <h3>Confident decisions and negotiation</h3>
      <p>비교 매물과 조건을 검토해 무리 없는 오퍼와 협상 전략을 세웁니다.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <div class="service-icon">04</div>
      <h2>Close <span>클로징</span></h2>
      <h3>Support through possession</h3>
      <p>인스펙션, 변호사, 최종 확인과 입주까지 필요한 다음 단계를 안내합니다.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="featured-guides" aria-label="Home buying guides">
    <div class="home-section-heading">
      <div><p class="page-kicker">Related Guides</p><h2>Helpful Before You Buy</h2></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/category/buy-sell/">모든 구매 가이드 보기</a>
    </div>
    <div class="home-posts">
      {guides.map((post) => (
        <article class="post-card">
          <p class="post-date">{formatDate(post.data.pubDate)}</p>
          <h2><a href={`/${post.slug}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h2>
          <p>{post.data.description}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-cta">
    <div>
      <p class="page-kicker">Next Step</p>
      <h2>Not sure where to begin?</h2>
      <p>Tell us your timing, budget and priorities. We will help you identify the most useful next step.</p>
      <a class="button primary" href="/contact/?source=buy_consultation">구매 상담 시작하기</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
